msgid "• {1}: ADSR on a Sync Buzzer — the hardware envelope drives the level"
msgstr "• {1}: ADSR auf einem Sync Buzzer - die Hardware-Hüllkurve steuert den Pegel"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "• {1}: Chipdrum uses sample tables here (Authentic 3ch synthesises it from registers)"
